Bundle-Name: Eclipse Fennec Inference MCP Runtime
Bundle-Description: Resolution anchor for the metamodel-inference feature. Provides osgi.implementation=mcp.inference \
 and requires the closure that feature needs: the EMF and metadata tools, the model.atlas publishing tool with its \
 provider config, and org.eclipse.fennec.mcp.inference.config. A runtime opts in with a single -runrequires on the \
 capability; the base EMF MCP runtime resolves and runs without any of it.
-workingset: emf

-buildpath: \
	org.osgi.framework;version=latest,\
	org.osgi.namespace.implementation;version=latest,\
	slf4j.api;version=latest,\
	org.eclipse.fennec.mcp.api;version=snapshot
